 <div class="container-fluid px-0">
    <div id="carouselExampleInterval" class="carousel slide" data-bs-ride="carousel">
        <div class="carousel-inner">

             <div class="carousel-item active" data-bs-interval="5000">
                <img src="/images/Facts/fact-main.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="prison-inside-image">
                <div class="carousel-caption d-flex d-md-block">
                    <h5>Facts you probably did not know about Germany !</h5>
                </div> 
            </div>   

            <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="2000">
                <img src="/images/Facts/prsion-fact-whole.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="prison-inside-image">
                <div class="carousel-caption d-flex d-md-block">
                    <h5>Escaping from prison is not illegal</h5>
                    <p>In Germany, attempting to break out of jail is not punishable by law. It’s considered a basic human instinct to seek freedom, as long as no other crimes (like hurting someone) are committed during the escape.</p>
                </div> 
            </div>   

            <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="2000">
                <img src="/images/Facts/fanta-fact.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="fanta-car-image">
                <div class="carousel-caption d-flex d-md-block">
                    <h5>Fanta was invented in Germany</h5>
                    <p>During WWII when Coca-Cola syrup couldn’t be imported due to the war, the German branch of the company created a new drink using available ingredients and that’s how Fanta was born.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="2000">
                <img src="/images/Facts/baby-fact-two.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="baby-face-image">
                <div class="carousel-caption d-flex d-md-block">
                <h5>Baby name and The Government</h5>
                <p>German authorities (the Standesamt) can reject a baby name if they believe it could harm the child’s well-being or is inappropriate. There are strict rules around this.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="2000">
                <img src="/images/Facts/beer-fact.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="beer-cheers-image">
                <div class="carousel-caption d-flex d-md-block">
                    <h5>Beer is legally considered a food</h5>
                    <p>In Germany, beer counts as a staple food item rather than just an alcoholic drink. This cultural view makes it perfectly normal to enjoy beer with lunch or dinner and in some places, it has even been cheaper than bottled water. Germany’s beer culture is incredibly deep and diverse over 1,300–1,500 breweries and thousands of beer varieties!</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="2000">
                <img src="/images/Facts/zoo-fact.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="zoo-animal-image">
                <div class="carousel-caption d-flex d-md-block">
                    <h5>Zoos'</h5>
                    <p>With over 400 zoos, Germany leads the world in this category, a reflection of its strong emphasis on wildlife, education, and conservation.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="carousel-item" data-bs-interval="2000">
                <img src="/images/Facts/black-forest-fact.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="black-forest-cake-image">
                <div class="carousel-caption d-flex d-md-block">
                    <h5>The Black Forest</h5>
                    <p>The famous Black Forest Cake is named after Germany's Black Forest region because it traditionally contains Kirsch the cherry brandy which was made there.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExampleInterval" data-bs-slide="prev">
            <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span>
        </button>

        <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExampleInterval" data-bs-slide="next">
            <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="visually-hidden">Next</span>
        </button>
    </div>
